    "n-play": {
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 480,
      "text": "How to review\nPress Play on any board. SA-02: search, filter, sort, open a request, decide; the list and the Requests badge update on that board. SA-03 boards start in a state and stay fully usable. Each board keeps its own state; links open other boards fresh.",
      "fill": "blue"
    },
    "n-ids": {
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 480,
      "text": "Rules kept from v46\nNo internal record IDs on Super Admin screens (IA screens keep ACC-0107, REQ-0042, SUP-0213). Course codes stay. No Decline and no manual “mark paid”. Internal access starts on approval; external access only after payment. Licence use is not shown (D7 open).",
      "fill": "teal"
    },
    "n-konark": {
      "x": 2560,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 480,
      "text": "Open record · Konark Polytechnic\nv46 B1-11 says it is paused and its term ends 24 Sep 2027; B7-01 and the approved SA-01 say its access ends 2 Nov 2026. SA-03 shows the pause and leaves the end date out. Please confirm which is right.",
      "fill": "orange"
    },
    "n-g58": {
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 470,
      "w": 480,
      "text": "Open record · Godavari, 60 more licences (21 Oct)\nThis request appears only on SA-01. Its contact person, experiment and formats are taken from Godavari’s single plan, and its received time is unknown. The confirmation text for extra licences at an existing external institution is derived from v46’s external copy.",
      "fill": "orange"
    },
    "n-code": {
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 470,
      "w": 480,
      "text": "Open record · IA-02 course code\nv46’s ending-soon, paused and ended boards say “code not added”, but IA-01 and v46’s 9 Oct 2026 state show MEC-523. These boards use MEC-523 from 9 Oct 2026 on.",
      "fill": "orange"
    },
    "n-more": {
      "x": 2560,
      "y": 470,
      "w": 480,
      "text": "Also noted\nSahyadri’s additional-licences request (18 Sep) predates “access active since 30 Sep” on SA-01. SUP-0213 is used in v46 for two different reports (3 Oct 2026 and 20 Sep 2027). Links to screens outside Batch 01 (Student access, Give students access, Course codes, plan details, request status, IA Requests, Help) are placeholders.",
      "fill": "yellow"
    }
  },
